```

### Cause:

Wrong field name.

### Fix:

Check API name in Object Manager.

---

## Error:

```text
Save doesn’t work
```

### Cause:

Required field missing.

---

## Error:

```text
List has no rows
```

### Cause:

Delete query record not found.

